    <!-- About -->
    <string name="mx_about_title">About Matixray</string>
    <string name="mx_about_body">This project is an upgraded build that contains V2Ray.\n\nV2Ray is an open-source platform for building secure, fast network connections. It supports protocols such as VMess, VLESS, Trojan and Shadowsocks, and encrypts and routes your traffic.\n\nMatixray is an Android client based on V2Ray and the Xray core, with a modern interface, day and night modes, automatic best-config search, Xfinder and Psiphon.</string>
